fix  matE   all property/global youngsModulus  peratomtype  5e8     5e8
fix  matNu  all property/global poissonsRatio  peratomtype  0.45    0.45

fix cor all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 2  0.1  0.1  0.1 0.1

fix mu  all property/global coefficientFriction    peratomtypepair 2  0.5  0.5  0.5  0.5

fix mur all property/global coefficientRollingFriction peratomtypepair 2  0.0  0.0  0.0  0.0

pair_style  gran model hertz tangential history rolling_friction cdt
pair_coeff  * *

timestep            1e-7
fix                 grav all gravity ${geff} vector ${gx} ${gy} ${gz}
fix                 zwalls1 all wall/gran model hertz tangential history rolling_friction cdt primitive type 1  zplane 0.0
fix                 zwalls2 all wall/gran model hertz tangential history rolling_friction cdt primitive type 1 zplane 5e-3

